sequenceDiagram
  participant M as Mission Authority
  participant S as SoS Architecture
  participant C as Cyber Assurance
  participant F as Cloud Migration
  M->>S: Approve mission outcome and measures
  S->>S: Baseline thread, requirements, systems, interfaces
  S->>F: Target architecture and migration constraints
  F->>S: Workload inventory, dependencies, wave proposal
  S->>C: Architecture baseline and evidence claims
  C->>F: Controls, readiness gates, evidence needs
  F->>C: Configuration, test, and migration evidence
  C->>M: Assurance posture and residual limitations
  M->>F: Cutover decision
  F->>S: Migration, stabilization, and legacy-exit status
